- Not imported: .github/, ci_scripts/, Images/, README.md, PRIVACY.MD, TERMS.MD.
- Removed the composer's remote text-rewrite and image-description features.
  Two source files were deleted (Network and StatusKit packages), and these
  were modified:
  Packages/StatusKit/Sources/StatusKit/Editor/Components/AccessoryView.swift
  Packages/StatusKit/Sources/StatusKit/Editor/Components/MediaEditView.swift
  Packages/StatusKit/Sources/StatusKit/Editor/ViewModel.swift
  Packages/Env/Sources/Env/UserPreferences.swift
  IceCubesApp/App/Tabs/Settings/SettingsTab.swift
  IceCubesApp/Resources/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings

2026-10-16, identity
- The bundle ids are now site.warpnet.warpfone, plus .ShareExtension,
  .ActionExtension and .Notifications. The display name is "Warpnet" and the
  URL scheme is warpfone://. The release team and bundle id prefix are set in
  IceCubesApp-release.xcconfig.
- The app group and keychain access group are read from the AppGroup and
  KeychainAccessGroup Info.plist keys, which derive from BUNDLE_ID_PREFIX and
  the team prefix. The iCloud container entitlement was removed.
- Files without the notice line:
  IceCubesApp.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
  IceCubesApp/Info.plist
  IceCubesApp/App/IceCubesApp.entitlements
  IceCubesApp/App/IceCubesApp-release.entitlements
  IceCubesNotifications/Info.plist
  IceCubesNotifications/IceCubesNotifications.entitlements
  IceCubesShareExtension/Info.plist
  IceCubesShareExtension/IceCubesShareExtension.entitlements

2026-10-16, services
- Removed the tip jar (RevenueCat) and the GIF search (Giphy), which ran on the
  Ice Cubes author's API keys. SupportAppView.swift and GIFPickerView.swift were
  deleted, and both packages were dropped from the project.
- The instances.social server directory used the author's token; the client now
  returns no suggestions.
- The app no longer asks for push notifications at launch, so no device token
  reaches the Ice Cubes push relay.
- Files without the notice line:
  IceCubesApp.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
  IceCubesApp.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcshareddata/swiftpm/Package.resolved
  IceCubesApp/Resources/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings

2026-10-16, about and settings
- About no longer links to the Ice Cubes privacy policy and terms of use, and
  no longer loads the Ice Cubes accounts. Its footer credits Ice Cubes.
- Settings points the source code link at the Warpnet repository and drops the
  App Store rating link.
- Files without the notice line:
  IceCubesApp/Resources/Localization/Localizable.xcstrings

2026-10-16, icons
- The Ice Cubes app icons were replaced with the Warpnet W (white on #C5007F),
  the same glyph the Android client and the desktop side navigation use. The 47
  alternate icons and the icon picker were removed.
